  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of the\r\nsite being located within an area of land liable to flooding and the lack of a\r\ncomprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, due to a lack of flood data/maps,\r\ncompensatory flood storage details and flood mitigation measures which take\r\ninto account the depth of the flood, has failed to demonstrate that the\r\nproposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site\r\nor increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024),&amp;nbsp;&lt;span aptos=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;SI12 and SI&amp;nbsp;13 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012),&amp;nbsp;Policy DM9 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013), and Policies CN3 and CN4 of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aptos=&quot;&quot;&gt;emerging Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
